  about
    'I am an AI engineer, programmer, developer, and team lead. I started programming at the age of 10, in the year 2000. Over this time, I have become familiar with and actively used a wide range of languages and technologies. I can perform the roles of a technical director and software architect. I prefer to communicate in writing, have significant experience in interpersonal communication and conflict resolution, and can coordinate development within and between teams. I also teach programming and how to use AI effectively. I can manage social media and interact with the audience. I write articles on programming and mathematics. I have a strong interest in mathematics, physics, psychology, and philosophy.'
    ' '
    'I am particularly interested in contributing to advances in water treatment and other water-related technologies, as well as medical, mining, and space technologies.'
